Q: Write text inside rectangle A: <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
 &lt;title&gt;test&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
 &lt;table border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
  &lt;tr&gt;
   &lt;td&gt;Bla!&lt;/td&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>Your post explicitly has categories HTML and title &quot;Write text inside rectangle&quot;.</p>
<p>Above is the solution I use everyday.</p>
